    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 1
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.05
  m_Text: 'E on the plate first, then the

    rune lock beside the door (the

    three
    symbols, 1-2-3) unlocks it.

    Through the door the grate at the

    far end
    of the hallway behind you

    bursts and three chase pufferfish

    come out:
    the dagger does nothing

    to them, three bites and you''re

    dead. Grab
    the two stone fragments

    (Space / Ctrl), slot them in the

    tablet by
    the far door, then take

    the trident at the end of the long

    corridor
    and the rubble seals it

    behind you.'
