    combat pen. E: hazard lane. SE:

    pickup
    shelf. S/E: doors. Centre:

    puzzles. SW: hatch and basement.

    W: movement
    course. N door: the

    chase. Walk up to a sign to read

    it. Turn around
    to meet the QA

    lead.'
